abstract: "Code, manifests and frozen results of a HIT401 capstone project (Charles Darwin University, Group 24) that evaluated OmniAID v2 on camera-trap, citizen-science and SDXL wildlife images, adapted it with parameter-efficient fine-tuning, and tested both detectors on FLUX.1-schnell images held out from project adaptation."
